          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bestätigung is the noun of bestätigen \"to confirm\", which is usually traced to the old adjective stet \"steady, firm\", of the family of stehen \"to stand\". EtymDB has no entries for these, so the account is hedged."
            }
          ]
        },
